        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Note: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early alpha version of what is planned to begin as an Arena-Shooter and then evolve into an Open World Sandbox with community-driven features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, it's a Single-Player test environment which I plan to continually update as more features are developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the Current State of this Project? :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the current version of this project, you will find fully fleshed-out firearm mechanics for a pistol and rifle; leaning, crouching, sprinting, climbing; a basic equipment system, and a drivable vehicle, as well as smaller details such as physics based item interactions and rag-doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is crafted with high-definition graphics and global illumination with attention to detail for an immersive realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the Goals of this Project? :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial mechanics &amp; systems I plan to add: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Implementing Host-Based Multiplayer with Steam Lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Adding more Firearms &amp; Equipment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Adding more Vehicles and improving Driving Mechanics &amp; Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Creating Small-Medium Levels for competitive play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Adding custom Character &amp; Item Models/Assets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term Goals:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Expanding Open World w/ Dynamic Features (weather, day-night cycle, etc...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Implementing an Inventory Management &amp; Crafting System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Adding AI/ NPC Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Porting over to Dedicated Servers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can provide direct feedback to me on X/Twitter: @BlankCanvasSB</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Note: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early alpha version of what is planned to begin as an Arena-Shooter and then evolve into an Open World Sandbox with community-driven features. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, it's a Single-Player test environment which I plan to continually update as more features are developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the Current State of this Project? :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the current version of this project, you will find fully fleshed-out firearm mechanics for a pistol and rifle; leaning, crouching, sprinting, climbing; a basic equipment system, and a drivable vehicle, as well as smaller details such as physics based item interactions and rag-doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is crafted with high-definition graphics and global illumination with attention to detail for an immersive realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the Goals of this Project? :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial mechanics &amp; systems I plan to add: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Implementing Host-Based Multiplayer with Steam Lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Adding more Firearms &amp; Equipment </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Adding more Vehicles and improving Driving Mechanics &amp; Audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4) Creating Small-Medium Levels for competitive play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5) Adding custom Character &amp; Item Models/Assets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-term Goals:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1) Expanding Open World w/ Dynamic Features (weather, day-night cycle, etc...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) Implementing an Inventory Management &amp; Crafting System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Adding AI/ NPC Systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Porting over to Dedicated Servers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can provide direct feedback to me on X/Twitter: @BlankCanvasSB</p>",
        "short_description": "A small, single-player environment to test my new game currently under development. Shoot guns, drive a car, and admire the scenery!",
